  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Statistics in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the knowledge of the social, demographic and economic characteristics of the people of Zimbabwe by strengthening the capacity of the Zimbabwe National Statistics Agency (ZIMSTAT) to develop, manage and coordinate the national statistical system effectively; to produce and disseminate quality data and statistics including key economic and social statistics; and the delivery of a successful census, by 2015. This will provide relevant, timely and reliable statistics needed to inform the design and implementation of key policies and programmes by Government of Zimbabwe, development aid partners and civil society organisations. This in turn contributes towards the MDG of poverty alleviation in Zimbabwe by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
